       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC500.
       AUTHOR.        A. WASHINGTON.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  08/14/98.
      *****************************************************************
      *  CODE TABLE MAINTENANCE - ALL SMALL TABLES LIVE IN CODTBL
      *
      *  PARAMETER: TABLE TYPE  REG SHP CAT TER DEM  (FROM MENU)
      *  08/14/98 AW         NEW - REPLACES 4 SEPARATE PROGRAMS
      *  02/02/02 AW   AW02  TERRITORY MUST POINT TO A REGION
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC500D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT CODTBL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CODTBL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CODTBL-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  CODTBL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CODTBLCP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-X                        PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODTBL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ERR                      PIC X     VALUE "N".
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-DTL-MSG                  PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODE                     PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-REGION                   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC500D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC500D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC500D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC500D.
       01  DTLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-I OF NWC500D.
       01  DTLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-O OF NWC500D.
      *  TABLE NAMES - SEARCHED WITH THE TYPE PASSED IN
       01  WS-TYPE-VALUES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE "REGREGIONS".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE "SHPSHIPPERS".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE "CATPRODUCT CATEGORIES".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE "TERSALES TERRITORIES".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE "DEMCUSTOMER DEMOGRAPHIC TYPES".
       01  WS-TYPE-TABLE REDEFINES WS-TYPE-VALUES.
           05  WS-TYPE-ENTRY OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY TX.
               10  WS-TYPE-CODE        PIC X(3).
               10  WS-TYPE-NAME        PIC X(30).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-TYPE                     PIC X(3).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-TYPE.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE.
           OPEN I-O CODTBL.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-O-AREA DTLREC-O-AREA.
           SET TX TO 1.
           SEARCH WS-TYPE-ENTRY
               AT END MOVE "UNKNOWN TABLE" TO C1TITL OF SFLCTL-O
               WHEN WS-TYPE-CODE(TX) = LK-TYPE
                   MOVE WS-TYPE-NAME(TX) TO C1TITL OF SFLCTL-O.
      *  WHICH EXTRA FIELDS DOES THIS TABLE USE (HARD CODED)
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(61).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(62).
           IF LK-TYPE = "SHP"
               MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(61)
               MOVE "PHONE" TO C1ALTH OF SFLCTL-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "CAT"
               MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(61)
               MOVE "LONG DESCRIPTION" TO C1ALTH OF SFLCTL-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "TER"
               MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(62)
               MOVE "REGION" TO C1ALTH OF SFLCTL-O.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END.
           IF WS-IND(06) = B"1"
               PERFORM 4000-ADD THRU 4000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW.
       9000-END.
           CLOSE DSPFILE CODTBL.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-CODE.
           START CODTBL KEY IS NOT LESS THAN CT-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ CODTBL NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           IF CT-TYPE NOT = LK-TYPE GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE CT-CODE TO S1CODE OF SFLREC-O H1CODE OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE CT-DESC TO S1DESC OF SFLREC-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "TER"
               MOVE CT-ALT2 TO S1ALT OF SFLREC-O
           ELSE
               MOVE CT-ALT1 TO S1ALT OF SFLREC-O.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 200 GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31).
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           MOVE H1CODE OF SFLREC-I TO WS-CODE.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "2"
               PERFORM 3000-CHANGE THRU 3000-EXIT.
      *  DELETE - NO CONFIRMATION, NO WHERE-USED CHECK
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE
               MOVE WS-CODE TO CT-CODE
               DELETE CODTBL RECORD INVALID KEY CONTINUE END-DELETE
               MOVE "CODE DELETED" TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-CHANGE.
           MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE WS-CODE TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           MOVE "CHANGE" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE CT-CODE TO D1CODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE CT-DESC TO D1DESC OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE CT-ALT1 TO D1ALT1 OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE CT-ALT2 TO D1ALT2 OF DTLREC-O.
       3000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 3000-SHOW.
      *  AW02 - THE REGION CHECK READ ANOTHER RECORD - READ AGAIN       AW02
           MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE.                                     AW02
           MOVE WS-CODE TO CT-CODE.                                     AW02
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY GO TO 3000-EXIT.                     AW02
           MOVE D1DESC OF DTLREC-I TO CT-DESC.
           MOVE D1ALT1 OF DTLREC-I TO CT-ALT1.
           MOVE D1ALT2 OF DTLREC-I TO CT-ALT2.
           REWRITE CODTBL-REC INVALID KEY GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           MOVE "CODE CHANGED" TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       3000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-ADD.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "ADD" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(40).
       4000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           IF D1CODE OF DTLREC-I = SPACES
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE "CODE IS REQUIRED" TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE D1CODE OF DTLREC-I TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY GO TO 4000-NEW.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51).
           MOVE "CODE ALREADY EXISTS" TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           GO TO 4000-SHOW.
       4000-NEW.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE LK-TYPE TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE D1CODE OF DTLREC-I TO CT-CODE.
           MOVE D1DESC OF DTLREC-I TO CT-DESC.
           MOVE D1ALT1 OF DTLREC-I TO CT-ALT1.
           MOVE D1ALT2 OF DTLREC-I TO CT-ALT2.
           WRITE CODTBL-REC INVALID KEY
               MOVE "CODE ALREADY EXISTS" TO WS-MSG-LINE
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           MOVE "CODE ADDED" TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7500-SHOW.
           MOVE C1TITL OF SFLCTL-O TO D1TITL OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE "Alt data 1 . . ." TO D1L1 OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE "Alt data 2 . . ." TO D1L2 OF DTLREC-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "SHP"
               MOVE "Phone  . . . . ." TO D1L1 OF DTLREC-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "CAT"
               MOVE "Long desc  . . ." TO D1L1 OF DTLREC-O.
           IF LK-TYPE = "TER"
               MOVE "Region code  . ." TO D1L2 OF DTLREC-O.
           IF WS-IND(61) = B"1"
               MOVE SPACES TO D1L1 OF DTLREC-O.
           IF WS-IND(62) = B"1"
               MOVE SPACES TO D1L2 OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE WS-DTL-MSG TO D1MSG OF DTLREC-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DTLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO DTLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING DTLREC-I TO DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(51).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(52).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(54).
       7500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       8000-EDIT.
           MOVE "N" TO WS-ERR.
           IF D1DESC OF DTLREC-I = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(52)
               MOVE "DESCRIPTION IS REQUIRED" TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           IF LK-TYPE NOT = "TER" GO TO 8000-EXIT.                      AW02
           MOVE "REG" TO CT-TYPE.                                       AW02
           MOVE D1ALT2 OF DTLREC-I TO CT-CODE.                          AW02
           READ CODTBL                                                  AW02
               INVALID KEY                                              AW02
                   MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR                                   AW02
                   MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(54)                              AW02
                   MOVE "REGION CODE NOT ON FILE" TO WS-DTL-MSG.        AW02
       8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
